{'symbol': 'WFC', 'date': '2022-08-24 22:26:00', 'title': 'WFC FINAL DEADLINE NOTICE: ROSEN, GLOBAL INVESTOR COUNSEL, ENCOURAGES WELLS FARGO & COMPANY INVESTORS TO SECURE COUNSEL BEFORE IMPORTANT AUGUST 29 DEADLINE IN SECURITIES CLASS ACTION - WFC', 'text': 'NEW YORK , AUG. 24, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- WHY: ROSEN LAW FIRM, A GLOBAL INVESTOR RIGHTS LAW FIRM, REMINDS PURCHASERS OF THE SECURITIES OF WELLS FARGO & COMPANY (NYSE: WFC) BETWEEN FEBRUARY 24, 2021 AND JUNE 9, 2022, BOTH DATES INCLUSIVE (THE "CLASS PERIOD"), OF THE IMPORTANT AUGUST 29, 2022 LEAD PLAINTIFF DEADLINE. SO WHAT:\xa0IF YOU PURCHASED WELLS FARGO SECURITIES DURING THE CLASS PERIOD YOU MAY BE ENTITLED TO COMPENSATION WITHOUT PAYMENT OF ANY OUT OF POCKET FEES OR COSTS THROUGH A CONTINGENCY FEE ARRANGEMENT.'}{'symbol': 'WFC', 'date': '2022-08-24 13:53:00', 'title': 'WFC LAWSUIT ALERT: LEVI & KORSINSKY NOTIFIES WELLS FARGO & COMPANY INVESTORS OF A CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT AND UPCOMING DEADLINE', 'text': 'NEW YORK, NEW YORK--(NEWSFILE CORP. - AUGUST 24, 2022) - LEVI & KORSINSKY, LLP NOTIFIES INVESTORS IN WELLS FARGO & COMPANY ("WELLS FARGO" OR THE "COMPANY") (NYSE: WFC) OF A CLASS ACTION SECURITIES LAWSUIT.THE LAWSUIT ON BEHALF OF WELLS FARGO INVESTORS HAS BEEN COMMENCED IN THE THE UNITED STATES DISTRICT COURT FOR THE NORTHERN DISTRICT OF CALIFORNIA.'}{'symbol': 'WFC', 'date': '2022-08-24 12:23:00', 'title': 'SHAREHOLDER ALERT: THE GROSS LAW FIRM NOTIFIES SHAREHOLDERS OF WELLS FARGO & COMPANY OF A CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT AND A LEAD PLAINTIFF DEADLINE OF AUGUST 29, 2022 - (NYSE: WFC)', 'text': 'NEW YORK , AUG. 24, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE GROSS LAW FIRM ISSUES THE FOLLOWING NOTICE TO SHAREHOLDERS OF WELLS FARGO & COMPANY. SHAREHOLDERS WHO PURCHASED SHARES OF WFC DURING THE CLASS PERIOD LISTED ARE ENCOURAGED TO CONTACT THE FIRM REGARDING POSSIBLE LEAD PLAINTIFF APPOINTMENT.'}{'symbol': 'WFC', 'date': '2022-08-24 08:24:00', 'title': 'MONDAY DEADLINE REMINDER: THE SCHALL LAW FIRM ENCOURAGES INVESTORS IN WELLS FARGO & COMPANY WITH LOSSES OF $100,000 TO CONTACT THE FIRM', 'text': 'LOS ANGELES, CALIFORNIA--(NEWSFILE CORP. - AUGUST 24, 2022) - THE SCHALL LAW FIRM, A NATIONAL SHAREHOLDER RIGHTS LITIGATION FIRM, REMINDS INVESTORS OF A CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT AGAINST WELLS FARGO & COMPANY ("WELLS FARGO" OR "THE COMPANY") (NYSE: WFC) FOR VIOLATIONS OF §§10(B) AND 20(A) OF THE SECURITIES EXCHANGE ACT OF 1934 AND RULE 10B-5 PROMULGATED THEREUNDER BY THE U.S. SECURITIES AND EXCHANGE COMMISSION.'}